1	//! Test-only strict TOON decoder and encoder-conformance validator — NOT part of the public API.
2	//!
3	//! It decodes the subset of TOON 4.4 (https://github.com/toon-format/spec, SPEC.md) that michi emits: a root object
4	//! whose entries are tabular arrays (§9.3), empty arrays `key: []` (§9.1), inline primitive arrays (§9.1), lists of
5	//! empty objects (§9.4/§10), and primitive fields (§8). Anything outside that subset is an error, not a guess.
6	//!
7	//! Beyond decoding, it rejects output a conforming *encoder* must not produce, so a passing decode proves the input
